  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.1 — Metadata + repository improvements release.\n\nNO LIBRARY CODE CHANGES — the OzaLog assembly is byte-identical to v3.0.0 (Deterministic build). Safe to upgrade with no compatibility risk.\n\nIMPROVED:\n- NuGet package metadata refreshed: cleaner Description, updated PackageTags (added ozalog/hft/high-performance/zero-dependency; removed misleading nlog tag), polished Title.\n- PackageReleaseNotes now uses absolute GitHub URLs for cross-references.\n\nTECHNICAL:\n- New project website: Nuxt 4 + @nuxt/content + Tailwind CSS, deployed to GitHub Pages.\n- Repository documentation restructured to docs/{en,zh-TW}/ bilingual tree.\n- GitHub Actions auto-deploys site on push.\n- Sponsor page added (USDT BEP20 + Binance Pay).\n- uplog release flow extended: now also creates GitHub Release and pushes to NuGet.org automatically.\n\nFor v2.x users still upgrading: https://github.com/ozakboy/OzaLog/blob/main/docs/en/migration.md\nFull changelog: https://github.com/ozakboy/OzaLog/blob/main/docs/en/changelog.md\nWebsite: https://ozakboy.github.io/OzaLog/",
